# VERBATIM data block data_l0925a from CCDC deposition 2245044 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1021/acs.inorgchem.3c00871 CCDC 2245044
# Neutral [(TSMP)2Fe(IV)] (4) as the hexakis-pyridine solvate (moiety C56H48FeN6P2, 6 C5H5N; crystals grown from pyridine/butyronitrile/ether as the paper states for 4); the other deposits are the Fe(III) anion salts 3a/3b and K/Ga analogues. CAUTION: the main text does not say which geometry the CASSCF(4,5)/NEVPT2 calculation used (SI S12 not on disk), and the paper also DFT-optimised 4 (BP86-D3BJ) in S=0,1,2; the crystal may not be the computed geometry.; crystal formula C86 H78 Fe N12 P2. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised. Embedded reflection data omitted.
